  - topicName: Demon Lord Quest
    keywords:
    - demon
    - demon lord
    - slay
    - boss
    - spire
    - kill demon
    plotInformation: The Demon Lord dwells high in the Obsidian Spire beyond the
      northern pass. Legend says only a weapon forged in sacred dragon flame can
      breach his shadow armor!
    isDiscovered: 0
  - topicName: Town Gate Key
    keywords:
    - gate
    - key
    - north gate
    - lock
    - escape
    plotInformation: The key to the North Town Gate was hidden inside the Starlight
      Tavern by Captain Thorne for safekeeping.
    isDiscovered: 0
